      "message": "fix(ui): hiding the world axes no longer hides the ground grid\n\nThe guard in ground_grid_lines read both show_world_axes and show_grid.\nThe grid now follows show_grid alone, and the axes follow show_world_axes\nalone. The hover texts, the doc comments and the law test change with it.\nThe Display menu test gets the missing direction: axes off, grid on.\n\nFixes #3322\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
